0..61 Comment "//! `streams` has observation functions and copattern blocks."
62..65 Comment "//!"
66..130 Comment "//! A productive recursive call stands as a whole copattern arm."
131..172 Comment "//! The refusal is unguarded corecursion."
173..232 Comment "//! Each observation yields before the function runs again."
233..280 Comment "//! So the fixpoint needs no termination claim."
281..284 Comment "//!"
285..362 Comment "//! The stream functions construct copattern blocks and observe their thunks."
363..424 Comment "//! Each test reads heads and tails from constructed streams."
425..428 Comment "//!"
429..444 Comment "//! - see: #644"
445..472 Comment "//! - see: #1499 — `ones`"
